NOTICE

Binflare is an independent reimplementation of the PrivateBin protocol,
written for Cloudflare Workers. No source code or assets from the
upstream project have been copied.

Upstream attribution
--------------------
Protocol baseline and behavioral reference: PrivateBin 2.1.0
(reference checkout 2.1.0-83-ga88aa802)

  - Repository:   https://github.com/PrivateBin/PrivateBin
  - Organization: @PrivateBin
  - Original author: Sebastien Sauvage
  - Copyright (c) Sebastien Sauvage and the PrivateBin contributors
  - Upstream license: Zlib/libpng
    (https://github.com/PrivateBin/PrivateBin/blob/master/LICENSE.md)

PrivateBin is a minimalist, open source online pastebin where the
server has zero knowledge of pasted data. Binflare implements the v2
wire format and JSON API independently, using modern browser APIs. It
does not use upstream's bundled third-party libraries (including the
GPLv2-licensed rawinflate) or upstream's CC-BY-licensed artwork.

Compatibility scope
-------------------
Binflare is protocol-compatible with PrivateBin 2.1.0's v2 format for
newly created pastes and comments. It does not support PrivateBin v1 or
ZeroBin, and it does not import or migrate data from an existing
instance. Protocol compatibility is not a claim of data migration or
drop-in replacement for an existing database.

Non-affiliation
